  "notAvailableInDemos": [
    "Gradle dependency and version catalog: the demos depend on project(\":core\") / project(\":compose\"), which no consumer can use. Hand-written on the pages with a Maven Central link instead of a pinned version.",
    "AndroidManifest application tag: the demo manifest carries unrelated launcher and icon attributes; the two relevant attributes stay hand-written.",
    "BaseActivity, bindTolgee helpers, tolgeeText ViewModel helper, per-environment BuildConfig URL: exist only in the starter apps, which are not part of any upstream tag.",
    "Compose installation page init block: examplejetpack/MyApplication.kt lacks availableLocaleTags and defaultLanguage (Tolgee defect to report); the Views demo block is used instead.",
    "Demo comments that mention the Tolgee compiler plugin (views MainActivity, multiplatform App) are removed with \"drop\": the plugin is disabled since Kotlin 2.2 and is not part of any release. Report to the SDK repository.",
